{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boned Again: Survivors is a fast-paced pixel arena platformer where you step into the armor of a fearless knight facing endless waves of enemies. Battle your way through four distinct locations \u2014 the Abandoned Ruins, Underground Mines, Icy Wastelands, and Infernal Depths \u2014 each guarded by a powerful boss. Collect gold from fallen foes to purchase and upgrade a variety of active and passive abilities in the shop. Level up during combat to enhance your powers, swap skills, or boost your passive bonuses. Every victory brings you closer to the next deadly challenge \u2014 and survival depends on how wisely you choose your upgrades.<br><br><i>Slash your way through relentless waves of enemies, level up your abilities, and prepare for epic boss battles in this fast-paced pixel arena platformer.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/5293afc956efdc6a9d2c6e260380313e.poster.avif?t=1755848526\" width=780 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/5293afc956efdc6a9d2c6e260380313e.webm?t=1755848526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/5293afc956efdc6a9d2c6e260380313e.mp4?t=1755848526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>Discover and stack a wide variety of active abilities, each with unique effects and playstyles. Combine them strategically to adapt to any battle and unleash devastating attacks against your enemies.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/7721177c4f9f9ff0f6ec55ed0a928d84.poster.avif?t=1755848526\" width=780 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/7721177c4f9f9ff0f6ec55ed0a928d84.webm?t=1755848526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/7721177c4f9f9ff0f6ec55ed0a928d84.mp4?t=1755848526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each time you level up, you\u2019ll be presented with three upgrade cards, each offering a unique way to grow stronger. Blue cards enhance one of your active abilities, making your attacks more powerful and versatile. Green cards let you swap one of your equipped active abilities for another from the abilities you\u2019ve purchased but haven\u2019t equipped yet, opening up new strategies on the fly. Purple cards boost your passive ability, granting permanent bonuses that can turn the tide of battle. Choose wisely \u2014 every upgrade shapes your playstyle and your chances of survival.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/472dcb8f3f449958fc14040bf0f77262.poster.avif?t=1755848526\" width=780 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/472dcb8f3f449958fc14040bf0f77262.webm?t=1755848526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/472dcb8f3f449958fc14040bf0f77262.mp4?t=1755848526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>Add the game to your wishlist to help it release faster!</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/c38o1y?t=1755848526\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3636480?t=1755848526","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3636480?t=1755848526","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/23fd884c0a44805af40edcd144369cfb3df20b75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755848526","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/23fd884c0a44805af40edcd144369cfb3df20b75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755848526","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boned Again: Survivors is a fast-paced pixel arena platformer where you step into the armor of a fearless knight facing endless waves of enemies. Battle your way through four distinct locations \u2014 the Abandoned Ruins, Underground Mines, Icy Wastelands, and Infernal Depths \u2014 each guarded by a powerful boss. Collect gold from fallen foes to purchase and upgrade a variety of active and passive abilities in the shop. Level up during combat to enhance your powers, swap skills, or boost your passive bonuses. Every victory brings you closer to the next deadly challenge \u2014 and survival depends on how wisely you choose your upgrades.<br><br><i>Slash your way through relentless waves of enemies, level up your abilities, and prepare for epic boss battles in this fast-paced pixel arena platformer.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/5293afc956efdc6a9d2c6e260380313e.poster.avif?t=1755848526\" width=780 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636480/extras/5293afc956efdc6a9d2c6e260380313e.webm?t=1755848526\" type=\"video/web